;- API design only — no callable functions are implemented in this module yet.
  Proposed functions:
      convert.toInt(number)
      convert.toFp(number)
      convert.parseInt(text)
      convert.parseFp(text)
      convert.toString(value)
      convert.hex(value)
      convert.bin(value)

  Parsing must distinguish valid zero from invalid input and must define overflow and
  precision behavior. Allocated string results also need an explicit ownership rule. -;
